  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "8DA4593E928F4587",
      "text": "歡迎光臨錦匯道館！\\n要再聽一次道館測驗的說明嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "8DA45A3E928F473A",
      "text": "錦匯道館的\\n道館測驗是……\\r\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]點一道秘密菜單[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "8DA45B3E928F48ED",
      "text": "及格條件是在錦匯鎮的\\n超人氣餐館[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]寶食堂[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]，\\r\\n點出他們的秘密菜單。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "8DA4543E928F3D08",
      "text": "目前除了[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳之外，\\n在這個鎮上還有３位\\r\\n道館測驗的挑戰者。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_05",
      "hash64": "8DA4553E928F3EBB",
      "text": "參加的每位都分別知道一個\\n關於秘密菜單的提示。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_06",
      "hash64": "8DA4563E928F406E",
      "text": "請去與其他挑戰者互相寶可夢對戰，\\n並由輸的一方告訴贏的一方\\r\\n自己擁有的那個提示。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_07",
      "hash64": "8DA4573E928F4221",
      "text": "最後根據收集到的提示，\\n向寶食堂的店員\\r\\n點這道秘密菜單。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_08",
      "hash64": "8DA4503E928F363C",
      "text": "成功點菜的那一位挑戰者，\\n就是道館測驗的及格者了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_09",
      "hash64": "8DA4513E928F37EF",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的提示是\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]常客的吃法[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_10",
      "hash64": "8DA7DE3E92925D5D",
      "text": "也許可以去向\\n寶食堂的常客打聽一下喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_normal_01",
      "hash64": "AE31BE5429DB5DDF",
      "text": "嚼啊嚼……\\n吃啊吃……[VAR 0x0114(0038)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0038"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_select_01",
      "hash64": "B588972BCEF95112",
      "text": "你是常客嗎……？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_select_02",
      "hash64": "B588962BCEF94F5F",
      "text": "那是秘密菜單？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_normal_02a",
      "hash64": "D9E80F031FC409E9",
      "text": "沒錯……我常來這家店。[VAR 0x0114(0038)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0038"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_normal_03a",
      "hash64": "D9EAF3031FC6102C",
      "text": "……[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳是道館測驗的挑戰者啊。[VAR 0x0114(0038)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0038"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_normal_02b",
      "hash64": "D9E80C031FC404D0",
      "text": "我現在吃的是\\n一般菜單上的菜。不過……[VAR 0x0114(0038)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0038"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_normal_04",
      "hash64": "AE31B95429DB5560",
      "text": "擠一些[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]檸檬[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]，\\n就會變得更清爽好吃。[VAR 0x0114(0038)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0038"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_normal_05",
      "hash64": "AE31BA5429DB5713",
      "text": "擠一些[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]檸檬[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]，\\n就會變得更清爽好吃。\\c\\n……這可能要長大了才會明白。[VAR 0x0114(0038)]",
